# Source-grounded exercise recipe: Wave I, Advanced Focus 10. The source tape
# moves directly through headphone orientation, the Energy Conversion Box,
# Resonant Tuning and the Resonant Energy Balloon before the full ten-point
# induction. It then teaches instant access and returns to waking awareness.
#
# Deliberately absent: the Affirmation, return-method briefing, Clear Skies and
# an open exploration hold. They belong to other exercises; adding them here
# would turn the source tape into the generic visit scaffold.

@title    Advanced Focus 10 — Instant Access
@level    F10
@ending   return
@pan      right
@seed     10103
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use orientation

surf 0.30
use conversion-box

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon

surf 0.0
use relax-10
use advanced-focus-10

use return
